  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to provide sub-skill training to vulnerable young adults, as well as institutional care leavers. The objective is that these participants will become independent and employable. The project is part of an ongoing Care Leavers club called Chautari Youth Club, where young adults leaving institutional Care and youth with vulnerable backgrounds can come for advice and information on what to do next and to live independently</narrative>
  </description>
